# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository holds CODE. Observations and fit products stay out of it.
#
# Both are reproducible from what IS tracked: the staged FITS come from the
# SAPPHIRES EDR release, and every result is regenerable from a config plus
# `python -m dingo.run <ID>`. The config is the artifact worth versioning -- it
# is the thing that records what was fitted and why -- and dingo.catalogs
# generates configs from the catalogue, so the provenance chain is complete
# without committing a single byte of data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Staged cutouts (R/C grism + direct image per source). Configs are KEPT.
data/**/*.fits

# Chains, checkpoints, derived posteriors, plots, run logs.
results/
logs/

# Superseded notebooks and a duplicate copy of the ID15665 cutouts.
Archive_6/

# Scratch output from the figure and map scripts.
maps/
*.log
